# A zero-power attacker deals no damage when its controller accepts the optional effect (CR 107.1b, 120.8).
[Bot1 Deck]
Gaze of Pain
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Swamp x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gaze of Pain.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Damage = 0
Bot2.Life = 20
